256L296.5 153.44l21.15-21.15c3.12-3.12 3.12-8.19 0-11.31l-22.63-22.63c-3.12-3.12-8.19-3.12-11.31 0L160 222.06 36.29 98.34c-3.12-3.12-8.19-3.12-11.31 0L2.34 120.97c-3.12 3.12-3.12 8.19 0 11.31L126.06 256 2.34 379.71c-3.12 3.12-3.12 8.19 0 11.31l22.63 22.63c3.12 3.12 8.19 3.12 11.31 0L160 289.94 262.56 392.5l21.15 21.15c3.12 3.12 8.19 3.12 11.31 0l22.63-22.63c3.12-3.12 3.12-8.19 0-11.31L193.94 256z"></path></svg></acu-icon><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----></div><div class="acu-expansion-panel__body text-base ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion" style="height: *; padding-top: *; padding-bottom: *;"><p itemscope="" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer"><span itemprop="text">Yes! Coverr video is a completely free stock footage website that allows you to download and use high-quality stock videos anywhere. And there is no catch! No sign-up needed, no attribution required or hidden tricks anywhere, when we say free, we mean it.</span></p></div></acu-expansion-panel><acu-expansion-panel itemscope="" itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="acu-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1598128937-39" ngh="42"><div class="acu-expansion-panel__header text-lg" jsaction="click:;"><span acu-panel-header="" itemprop="name"> Can Coverr Videos be used for commercial projects? </span><button acu-icon-button="" color="secondary" class="acu-expansion-panel__btn acu-icon-button acu-button acu-medium acu-radius-base acu-secondary" aria-label="Toggle item" ngh="17"><!----><!----><acu-icon svgicon="chevronDown" acu-icon-hydrated="chevronDown" style="height: 20px; width: 20px;" class="acu-icon acu-secondary" ngh="0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="-112 -128 672 768"><path d="M441.9 167.3l-19.8-19.8c-4.7-4.7-12.3-4.7-17 0L224 328.2 42.9 147.5c-4.7-4.7-12.3-4.7-17 0L6.1 167.3c-4.7 4.7-4.7 12.3 0 17l209.4 209.4c4.7 4.7 12.3 4.7 17 0l209.4-209.4c4.7-4.7 4.7-12.3 0-17z"></path></svg></acu-icon><!----><!----><!----></button><!----></div><div class="acu-expansion-panel__body text-base ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion" style="height: 0; padding-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0;"><p itemscope="" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer"><span itemprop="text">Of course you can, please do!</span></p></div></acu-expansion-panel><acu-expansion-panel itemscope="" itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="acu-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1598128937-40" ngh="42"><div class="acu-expansion-panel__header text-lg" jsaction="click:;"><span acu-panel-header="" itemprop="name"> Do you have an API? </span><button acu-icon-button="" color="secondary" class="acu-expansion-panel__btn acu-icon-button acu-button acu-medium acu-radius-base acu-secondary" aria-label="Toggle item" ngh="17"><!----><!----><acu-icon svgicon="chevronDown" acu-icon-hydrated="chevronDown" style="height: 20px; width: 20px;" class="acu-icon acu-secondary" ngh="0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="-112 -128 672 768"><path d="M441.9 167.3l-19.8-19.8c-4.7-4.7-12.3-4.7-17 0L224 328.2 42.9 147.5c-4.7-4.7-12.3-4.7-17 0L6.1 167.3c-4.7 4.7-4.7 12.3 0 17l209.4 209.4c4.7 4.7 12.3 4.7 17 0l209.4-209.4c4.7-4.7 4.7-12.3 0-17z"></path></svg></acu-icon><!----><!----><!----></button><!----></div><div class="acu-expansion-panel__body text-base ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion" style="height: 0; padding-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0;"><p itemscope="" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer"><span itemprop="text">Yes, we do! Check out our <a href="/developers" aria-label="Developers page" class="acu-link">API documentation</a> for more details.</span></p></div></acu-expansion-panel><!----></acu-expansion-list><div class="wa-faq-section__more"><!----><span class="text-base">Still have questions?</span><a acu-flat-button="" color="secondary" acurouterlink="/license" class="acu-flat-button acu-button acu-medium acu-radius-base acu-secondary" href="/license" ngh="1" jsaction="click:;"><!----> See