llection","new_collection":"New collection","no_collections":"No collections yet","start_exploring":"Start exploring","update_collection":"Update collection","create_new_collection":"Create new collection"},"value_prop_modal":{"title":"Make it yours \u003Cspan class=\"color-new-primary-main\">with AI\u003C/span>","footer":"Ready for more? Check details on","description":"Thanks for downloading — that clip’s yours. Sign up free to save the next one, and the next thousand.","primary_cta_copy":"Sign up free","propositions_section_label":"What you’ll get with a free account:"},"ai_models_section":{"cta":"Try now","title":"Turn your ideas into beautiful AI creations today","description":"Craft new AI visuals or rework any asset from our full stock library — limitless creative possibilities"},"ai_voices_filters":{"age":"Age","accent":"Accent","gender":"Gender","use_case":"Use case"},"cancellation_flow":{"form":{"title":"We are sorry to see you go.","buttons":{"stay":"Stay with Coverr+","cancel":"Cancel Subscription"},"reasons":["I only needed one video","Not enough premium videos available","AI generator quality isn’t good enough","I found a better alternative","I’m not using the service enough","The subscription is too expensive"],"request":"Can you share more about your reason? \u003Cspan class=\"wa-cancel-modal-last__secondary\">(optional)\u003C/span>","description":"Could you please tell us what led you to cancel your subscription?","cancel_reason":"Please, select a reason for canceling"},"hint":"\u003Csup>*\u003C/sup> Your subscription and AI credits stay active until the end of the billing period. You can still access your old AI generated content","title":"Cancel \u003Cspan class=\"color-gradient-blue\">Coverr+\u003C/span> \u003Cbr /> subscription?","values":[{"link":"/studio","text_1":"Full ","text_2":"access and monthly AI credits","ga_event":"cancellation_flow_retention_ai_studio_link","link_label":"AI studio "},{"link":"/stock-video-footage","link_2":"/free-stock-music","text_2":"&","text_3":"for comercial projects","ga_event":"cancellation_flow_retention_4K_footage_link","ga_event_2":"cancellation_flow_retention_wav_music_link","link_label":"4K footage","link_label_2":"WAV music"},{"link":"/stock-video-footage/plus","text_2":"added weekly","ga_event":"cancellation_flow_retention_exclusive_content_link","link_label":"Exclusive content"},{"link":"/profile/edit","text_2":"experience","ga_event":"cancellation_flow_retention_ad_free_link","link_label":"Ad-free"}],"buttons":{"stay":"Stay with Coverr+","cancel":"Cancel Subscription"},"discount":{"title":"One last thing","accept_button":"I’ll take it","cancel_button":"Cancel Subscription","error_message":"There was an error activating your discount. Please try again.","success_message":"Thanks for staying — your subscription will include your discount starting with the next billing period.","description_year":"How about 20% off your yearly renewal as a thank-you for staying with us?","description_month":"How about 50% off your subscription for the next 3 months?"},"feedback":{"text":"Coverr+ is the ultimate creative hub —premium-quality videos, images, and music, combined with powerful AI tools to generate fresh content.","author":"Anna Patel, Social Media Manager"},"description":"You’re about to lose access to your premium AI and creative benefits:"},"contribute_banner":{"title":"Contribute and get discovered","subtitle":"Are you an AI video enthusiast? We would love to feature your work.","benefit_1":"Get more followers","benefit_2":"Inspire others and get inspired","benefit_3":"Join our exclusive community"},"exit_intent_modal":{"title":"Here’s how Coverr stays free","eyebrow":"Before you go","description":"Coverr’s free library is supported by our partner iStock and by our Plus subscribers. Pick whichever suits you — no pressure.","dismiss_copy":"Keep browsing","plus_cta_copy":"Go Plus — ad-free, 4K, full library","istock_promo_cta_copy":"Use iStock with -{{discount}} (code \"{{code}}\")","istock_library_cta_copy":"Browse iStock’s full library"},"help_and_feedback":{"email":{"errors":{"regex":"Please enter a valid email address","required":"Email is required"},"placeholder":"example@example.com"},"toast":{"error":"There was an error sending feedback.","success":"Your feedback has been sent successfully!"},"message":{"errors":{"required":"Message is required"},"placeholder":"Add feedback here..."}},"projects_selector":{"title":"Select a project","delete_modal":{"body":"All creations in this project will be permanently deleted.","title":"Delete this project?","confirm_copy":"Delete project"},"search_placeholder":"Search projects","default_project_name":"Default project","new_project_cta_copy":"New project","create_project_success":"Project created successfully","project_name_placeholder":"Project name"},"subscription_page":{"faq":[{"answer":"Coverr Plus is our premium subscription plan offering members exclusive access to high-quality stock footage, ad-free browsing, 4K video resolution, high-quality WAV format music, and other exciting features and enhancements.","question":"What is Coverr Plus?"},{"answer":"Our team curates and adds fresh, exclusive content to Coverr Plus every week, providing members with a constantly growing library of captivating footage and music tracks for their projects.","question":"How often does Coverr Plus add new content?"},{"answer":"With a Coverr Plus subscription, you can enjoy browsing our platform without any ads or sponsored content, allowing you to concentrate on selecting the perfect footage and music for your creative projects. If you prefer to leave these sponsored content recommendations, you can turn it on.","question":"What does the ad-free experience entail?"},{"answer":"No, access to 4K video resolution and high-quality WAV format music is exclusively available to our Coverr Plus members.","question":"Is 4K footage and WAV music available for free users?"},{"answer":"Simply click on \"Get Coverr+\" or \"See Pricing\" to view our subscription plans, choose the one that best suits your needs, and follow the steps to upgrade your account.","question":"How do I upgrade to Coverr Plus?"},{"answer":"Yes, you can cancel your subscription at any time. Once canceled, your subscription will remain active until the end of your current billing cycle.","question":"Can I cancel my Coverr Plus subscription anytime?"},{"answer":"Coverr Plus content can be used for both personal and commercial projects. For more information on usage rights and restrictions, please refer to our terms of service and licensing agreements.","question":"What are the usage rights and restrictions for Coverr Plus content?"},{"answer":"No, Coverr Plus subscriptions are for single-user licenses only. Only the account owner has the right to use the content. A company can have an account, but it remains a single seat-license, meaning only one person can download and select content/use the content at a time, and it cannot be stored on a DAM for broad sharing rights.","question":"Can I share my Coverr Plus subscription with someone else?"},{"answer":"Yes, your Coverr Plus subscription will automatically renew at the end of each billing period. This ensures uninterrupted access to the features and content provided by Coverr Plus. However, you have the flexibility to cancel your subscription at any time before the renewal date.","question":"Does my subscription automatically renew?"},{"answer":"We offer various payment methods to make it convenient for you to subscribe to Coverr Plus. Currently, we accept major credit cards and PayPal.","question":"What payment methods do you offer?"}],"meta":{"title":"Buy 4K Videos for Commercial Use: Pay for Ultra HD Video","description":"Buy 4K & Ultra HD Videos and WAV Music for Commercial Use ✅ Unlock premium stock footage, ad-free browsing, and high-quality formats."}},"user_upload_modal":{"select":{"or":"or","title":"Upload new Video","size_hint":"Minimum 640px 