ltra-low-latency needs, On-device or highly constrained compute environments, Highly specialized 3D/VFX or simulation workloads, From-scratch factual research without external data connections"}},"featurePrices":{"resolution":{"4K":8000,"480P":0,"720P":0,"1080P":2000}},"translations":{"de":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 führt zu den umfassendsten multimodalen Inhaltsreferenz- und Bearbeitungsfunktionen in der Branche"},"es":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduce a las capacidades de referencia y edición de contenidos multimodales más completas de la industria"},"fr":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduit à la référence et aux capacités d’édition de contenu multimodales les plus complètes du secteur"},"it":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 porta alla più completa capacità di riferimento e modifica dei contenuti multimodali del settore"},"nl":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leidt tot de meest uitgebreide multimodale contentreferentie- en bewerkingsmogelijkheden in de industrie"},"pt":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leva à referência e edição de conteúdo multimodal mais abrangentes da indústria"}}},"video":null,"presets":[]},{"id":"QfNBfETazYqG","createdAt":"2026-07-07T05:12:10.338Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-16T12:52:40.039Z","name":"Pro Try On","title":"Pro Try On","description":"High-end fashion commercial combining structural model poses with high-detail textile macro cuts.","icon":"sparkling","type":"marketing_commercial","videoDetailsFeatured":false,"order":13,"key":"pro_try_on","mode":"reference-to-video","widgetConfig":null,"promptTemplate":"# ROLE & OBJECTIVE\nYou are the dedicated backend AI generator for the \"Pro Try On\" video prompt application. Your task is to create an editorial, high-fashion studio commercial prompt that strips away domestic elements and focuses on structural tailoring.\n\n# USER PROMPT PRIORITY\nThe user defines the high-fashion model, the designer apparel collection, and color choices.\n\n# VIDEO PROMPT FRAMEWORK\n- **Studio Environment Lock:** You must state: \"The background is strictly a solid minimalist studio cyclorama wall with premium gradient drop-shadows. Absolutely no domestic apartment features, no windows, no furniture.\"\n- **Model Profile & Expression:** \"High-fashion editorial model. Expressions must remain neutral, detached, and high-fashion. Sharp, piercing gaze with zero forced smiling or unnatural gestures.\"\n- **Rhythmic Cut Breakdown:**\n  - **0–3s (Editorial Pose):** Wide shot. The model stands in a structural, geometric fashion pose, slowly shifting their shoulders to catch the overhead studio rim lighting.\n  - **3–6s (Macro Structure):** Fast cut to a tight macro close-up of the textile micro-structure, detailing the fabric weave, premium stitching lines, and tailored cuts.\n  - **6–8s (The Clean Stride):** Medium full shot. The model performs a slow, elegant, linear steel stride forward along the cyclorama floor.\n\n# UNIVERSAL QUALITY CHECKLIST\n- Standard domestic background items entirely prohibited (solid cyclorama required).\n- Model emotional state strictly specified as neutral/detached high-fashion.\n- Chronological breakdown using exact cuts and macro text close-ups.\n\n# CRITICAL GENERATION RULES\n- **Lighting Spec:** \"High-contrast editorial lighting, sharp key light, soft fill, geometric shadows cast onto the cyclorama wall behind.\"\n- **Output:** Output ONLY the final video prompt inside one markdown code block. No intro/outro text.\n\n# FEW-SHOT EXAMPLE\n**User Input:** \"Men's black tuxedo, model on a runway or in a studio, high fashion, sharp poses.\"\n**Expected Output:**\nHigh-fashion editorial commercial look, vertical 9:16, ultra-sharp detail, high-contrast studio output. The background is strictly a solid minimalist dark gray studio cyclorama wall with premium gradient drop-shadows. Absolutely no domestic apartment features, no furniture. High-fashion male editorial model with a neutral, detached expression and a sharp, piercing gaze directed slightly off-lens. 0–3s (Editorial Pose): Wide shot. The model stands in a structural, geometric fashion pose, slowly shifting his torso to catch an overhead high-contrast studio key light. 3–6s (Macro Structure): Fast rhythmic cut to a tight macro close-up of the black textile micro-structure, detailing the thick premium wool weave, satin lapel edges, and precise tailoring seams. 6–8s (The Clean Stride): Medium full shot. The model performs a slow, elegant, linear steel stride forward along the cyclorama floor, fabric folding cleanly with realistic weight.","videoId":null,"modelId":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","model":{"id":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","createdAt":"2026-04-10T13:00:31.405Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-23T14:55:48.019Z","key":"seedance-2-0","slug":"seedance-2-0","name":"Seedance 2.0","logo":"byteDance","type":"video","order":1,"toolId":"7yaoOMo1Aj","description":"Seedance 2.0 leading to the most comprehensive multimodal content reference and editing capabilities in the industry","freeGenerations":0,"maxPromptLength":5000,"pricePerUnit":2000,"minimumUnits":4,"unitLabelSingular":"video","unitLabelPlural":"videos","generationTime":300,"isActive":true,"isNew":null,"isPremium":true,"isFeatured":true,"hasGenerator":true,"totalItems":34,"provider":"fal","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-uwc70vdmqmiu-8dvxs8dvdzulrtqnlc04ee7e8374f9eae40adafba96b0199b3d05-Fm4tot","providerConfig":{"mappingExpression":"{\n    \"prompt\": prompt,\n    \"resolution\": config.resolution ?: \"480p\",\n    \"duration\": $string(config.duration) ?: \"4\",\n    \"aspect_ratio\": config.ratio ?: \"16:9\",\n    \"generate_audio\": config.generateAudio ?: false,\n    \"image_url\": config.promptImage,\n    \"end_image_url\": config.lastFrame\n}","requestEndpointSlug":"https://queue.fal.run/bytedance/seedance-2.0/requests/$REQUEST_ID","textToVideoEndpointSlug":"https://queue.fal.run/bytedance/seedance-2.0/text-to-video","imageToVideoEndpointSlug":"https://queue.fal.run/bytedance/seedance-2.0/image-to-video","videoToVid