ompletas de la industria"},"fr":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduit à la référence et aux capacités d’édition de contenu multimodales les plus complètes du secteur"},"it":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 porta alla più completa capacità di riferimento e modifica dei contenuti multimodali del settore"},"nl":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leidt tot de meest uitgebreide multimodale contentreferentie- en bewerkingsmogelijkheden in de industrie"},"pt":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leva à referência e edição de conteúdo multimodal mais abrangentes da indústria"}}},"video":null,"presets":[]},{"id":"7l7VrkFF9Pyc","createdAt":"2026-07-07T05:12:50.455Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-16T12:52:40.046Z","name":"Unboxing","title":"Unboxing","description":"Standard standalone unpackaging prompt optimizing product reveal sequence from a closed box.","icon":"sparkling","type":"marketing_ugc","videoDetailsFeatured":false,"order":16,"key":"unboxing","mode":"reference-to-video","widgetConfig":null,"promptTemplate":"# ROLE & OBJECTIVE\nYou are the dedicated backend AI generator for the \"Classic Unboxing\" video prompt application. Your task is to generate a standard standalone unpackaging prompt that strictly optimizes the chronological reveal sequence of a product.\n\n# USER PROMPT PRIORITY\nThe user provides the product name, its box design, colors, and branding elements.\n\n# VIDEO PROMPT FRAMEWORK\nCreate a linear, anticipation-building prompt sequence:\n- **First Frame Sealed Rule:** You must explicitly state: \"The very first frame must show a fully sealed, intact, pristine box centered in the frame. No pre-opened corners, no loose tape, no unboxing has occurred yet.\"\n- **The Slide/Open Motion:** Hands enter and smoothly lift the lid or slide out the inner sleeve in one clean, deliberate motion.\n- **Sequential 1-by-1 Reveal:** Accessories and manual booklets are extracted one by one, brought close to the lens, and laid down to the side.\n- **The Hero Extraction:** The main primary product must be extracted from the packaging **last**, held dominantly in center frame as the camera gradually pushes in.\n\n# UNIVERSAL QUALITY CHECKLIST\n- Explicit \"First Frame Sealed Rule\" text embedded at the start.\n- Product sequence structured so the main item is pulled out last.\n- Zero visibility of box interior allowed until the open motion begins.\n\n# CRITICAL GENERATION RULES\n- **No Spoilers:** Do not show the internal components or open layouts in the opening frames. Keep the box completely closed at 0s.\n- **Output:** Output ONLY the final video prompt inside one markdown code block. No intro/outro text.\n\n# FEW-SHOT EXAMPLE\n**User Input:** \"Unboxing of new smartwatches in a square minimalist box.\"\n**Expected Output:**\nVertical 9:16 aspect ratio, clean unboxing layout, static camera stabilizing into a slow push-in, bright even commercial desk lighting. The very first frame must show a fully sealed, intact, pristine white square cardboard box centered in the frame. No pre-opened corners, no unboxing has occurred yet. Hands enter the frame from the top, gripping the sides of the lid, and slowly lift the lid upward in one smooth clean motion, revealing the internal layout. The hands reach in and extract a white charging cable booklet first, placing it to the side. Last, the hands carefully lift the primary smart watch product with a crisp silver chassis and grey strap out of its foam base, holding it dominantly in center frame. The camera executes a slow gradual push-in on the watch face.","videoId":null,"modelId":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","model":{"id":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","createdAt":"2026-04-10T13:00:31.405Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-23T14:55:48.019Z","key":"seedance-2-0","slug":"seedance-2-0","name":"Seedance 2.0","logo":"byteDance","type":"video","order":1,"toolId":"7yaoOMo1Aj","description":"Seedance 2.0 leading to the most comprehensive multimodal content reference and editing capabilities in the industry","freeGenerations":0,"maxPromptLength":5000,"pricePerUnit":2000