tanding, High-fidelity precision edits and style consistency, Scalable enterprise-ready workflows and integrations","primaryPurpose":"Create, search, and precisely edit text, image, audio, and video using rich cross-modal references to maintain consistent style and intent","bestFitScenarios":"Reference-rich pipelines requiring strict brand/style consistency, High-volume content operations needing unified cross-modal search and edit, Post-production finishing and QA, Centralized asset libraries seeking versioning and rapid localization","knownLimitations":"Output quality depends on reference quality and coverage, Long-form or high-resolution media may increase latency and cost, Human review recommended for nuanced creative decisions and regulatory compliance, Limited suitability for offline/on-device use","poorFitScenarios":"Real-time live streaming edits or ultra-low-latency needs, On-device or highly constrained compute environments, Highly specialized 3D/VFX or simulation workloads, From-scratch factual research without external data connections"}},"featurePrices":{"resolution":{"4K":8000,"480P":0,"720P":0,"1080P":2000}},"translations":{"de":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 führt zu den umfassendsten multimodalen Inhaltsreferenz- und Bearbeitungsfunktionen in der Branche"},"es":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduce a las capacidades de referencia y edición de contenidos multimodales más completas de la industria"},"fr":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduit à la référence et aux capacités d’édition de contenu multimodales les plus complètes du secteur"},"it":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 porta alla più completa capacità di riferimento e modifica dei contenuti multimodali del settore"},"nl":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leidt tot de meest uitgebreide multimodale contentreferentie- en bewerkingsmogelijkheden in de industrie"},"pt":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leva à referência e edição de conteúdo multimodal mais abrangentes da indústria"}}},"video":null,"presets":[]},{"id":"87GYeLIwiYYA","createdAt":"2026-07-07T05:13:32.306Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-16T12:52:40.066Z","name":"Giant Figure","title":"Giant Figure","description":"Visual focus layout optimizing dramatic scaling or high-impact size contrasts in frame.","icon":"sparkling","type":"marketing_ugc","videoDetailsFeatured":false,"order":21,"key":"giant_figure","mode":"reference-to-video","widgetConfig":null,"promptTemplate":"# ROLE & OBJECTIVE\nYou are the dedicated backend AI generator for the \"Giant Figure\" video prompt application. Your task is to generate a prompt that creates a flawless, mathematically convincing scale contrast between a massive object/character and a normal environment.\n\n# USER PROMPT PRIORITY\nThe user defines what object, product, or character is amplified to a giant size.\n\n# VIDEO PROMPT FRAMEWORK\nGenerate a prompt centered around spatial geometry and optical depth:\n- **Geometric Anchor:** You MUST include a standard-sized anchor object in the immediate vicinity to calibrate the scale distortion (e.g., a standard-sized car, a standard domestic doorway, a regular chair right next to the giant object).\n- **Camera Depth & Angle:** \"Extreme low-angle upward tilt shot, look upward from ground level toward the sky. Severe perspective distortion emphasizing vertical height. Deep depth of field keeping both the foreground anchor object and the massive towering object in sharp focus.\"\n\n# UNIVERSAL QUALITY CHECKLIST\n- A concrete geometric anchor object of known proportions must be in frame.\n- Explicit low-angle upward tilting camera instructions are mandatory.\n- Deep depth of field specified to keep both foreground and background objects sharp.\n\n# CRITICAL GENERATION RULES\n- **Proportion Lock:** Ensure the AI holds the relative proportions steady, avoiding blurry edges or scaling glitches.\n- **Output:** Output ONLY the final video prompt inside one markdown code block. No intro/outro text.\n\n# FEW-SHOT EXAMPLE\n**User Input:** \"A giant can of Coca-Cola soda standing in the middle of a regular city street.\"\n**Expected Output:**\nExtreme low-angle upward tilt shot, vertical 9:16 aspect ratio, camera positioned at ground level looking up. A massive, towering red aluminum Coca-Cola soda can stands vertically in the center of a normal urban asphalt street, rising higher than the surrounding buildings. Directly next to the base of the can sits a standard-sized yellow sedan car, serving as a geometric reference anchor to emphasize the massive scale distortion. The camera tilts upward sharply, creating severe perspective lines pointing toward the sky. Deep depth of field keeping the metal textures of the giant can lid and the details of the small car in sharp focus simultaneously. Natural bright daylight casting a massive, accurate shadow from the can across the street and buildings.","videoId":null,"modelId":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","model":{"id":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","createdAt":"2026-04-10T13:00:31.405Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-23T14:55:48.019Z","key":"seedance-2-0","slug":"seedance-2-0","name":"Seedance 2.0","logo":"byteDance","type":"video","order":1,"toolId":"7yaoOMo1Aj","description":"Seedance 2.0 leading to the most comprehensive multimodal content reference and editing capabilities in the industry","freeGenerations":0,"maxPromptLength":5000,"pricePerUnit":2000,"minimumUnits":4,"unitLabelSingular":"video","unitLabelPlural":"videos","generationTime":300,"isActive":true,"isNew":null,"isPremium":true,"isFeatured":true,"hasGenerator":true,"totalItems":34,"provider":"fal","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-uwc70vdmqmiu-8dvxs8dvdzulrtqnlc04ee7e8374f9eae40adafba96b0199b3d05-Fm4tot","providerConfig":{"mappingExpression":"{\n    \"prompt\": prompt,\n    \"resolution\": config.resolution ?: \"480p\",\n    \"duration\": $string(config.duration) ?: \"4\",\n    \"aspect_ratio\": config.ratio ?: \"16:9\",\n    \"generate_audio\": config.generateAudio ?: false,\n    \"image_url\": config.promptImage,\n    \"end_im