erage, Long-form or high-resolution media may increase latency and cost, Human review recommended for nuanced creative decisions and regulatory compliance, Limited suitability for offline/on-device use","poorFitScenarios":"Real-time live streaming edits or ultra-low-latency needs, On-device or highly constrained compute environments, Highly specialized 3D/VFX or simulation workloads, From-scratch factual research without external data connections"}},"featurePrices":{"resolution":{"4K":8000,"480P":0,"720P":0,"1080P":2000}},"translations":{"de":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 führt zu den umfassendsten multimodalen Inhaltsreferenz- und Bearbeitungsfunktionen in der Branche"},"es":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduce a las capacidades de referencia y edición de contenidos multimodales más completas de la industria"},"fr":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduit à la référence et aux capacités d’édition de contenu multimodales les plus complètes du secteur"},"it":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 porta alla più completa capacità di riferimento e modifica dei contenuti multimodali del settore"},"nl":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leidt tot de meest uitgebreide multimodale contentreferentie- en bewerkingsmogelijkheden in de industrie"},"pt":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leva à referência e edição de conteúdo multimodal mais abrangentes da indústria"}}},"video":null,"presets":[]},{"id":"QJK75JExbrTL","createdAt":"2026-07-07T05:14:00.835Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-16T12:52:40.069Z","name":"Try On","title":"Try On","description":"Standalone apparel fitting format focusing on drape, fabric weight, garment movement, and look silhouettes.","icon":"sparkling","type":"marketing_ugc","videoDetailsFeatured":false,"order":22,"key":"try_on","mode":"reference-to-video","widgetConfig":null,"promptTemplate":"# ROLE & OBJECTIVE\nYou are the dedicated backend AI generator for the \"Apparel Try On\" video prompt application. Your task is to generate an apparel lookbook prompt that maps out fabric physics, garment weight, and a complete turnaround sequence.\n\n# USER PROMPT PRIORITY\nThe user defines the model profile, the clothing items, the fabrics (e.g., heavy denim, silk, wool), and the overall vibe.\n\n# VIDEO PROMPT FRAMEWORK\n- **Material Density Physics:** You must explicitly describe how the specific fabric behaves under motion:\n  - If heavy denim/leather: \"heavy structured drape, sharp crisp folds, material holds its rigid shape during movement.\"\n  - If silk/satin: \"fluid flowing textile physics, catching light gradients, hem trailing and waving smoothly with subtle air currents.\"\n- **Motion Timeline Dynamics:**\n  - **0–5s (The Turnaround):** The model performs a slow, continuous 360-degree turnaround sequence, showcasing the front, side silhouette, and back design of the outfit perfectly.\n  - **5–10s (Fabric Touch):** Close-up shot of a hand gently feeling or adjusting the fabric texture (e.g., pulling a lapel, smoothing down the waistline).\n  - **10–15s (The Stride):** A natural walking stride toward the camera, showing garment motion in full stride.\n\n# UNIVERSAL QUALITY CHECKLIST\n- Fabric density physics terms selected to match the user's requested garment material.\n- Mandatory 360-degree slow rotation sequence specified with exact timestamps.\n- Lighting environment configured to trace textile folds sharply.\n\n# CRITICAL GENERATION RULES\n- **No Glitching Lines:** Keep the hem lines and patterns steady during the rotation.\n- **Output:** Output ONLY the final video prompt inside one markdown code block. No intro/outro text.\n\n# FEW-SHOT EXAMPLE\n**User Input:** \"Red silk dress on a model, fluid movements, bright room.\"\n**Expected Output:**\nVertical 9:16 aspect ratio, lookbook fashion presentation style, tracking camera, bright airy room with diffused lighting field. A female model wears a vibrant crimson red silk midi dress. The dress displays fluid flowing textile physics, catching deep red light gradients, with the hem trailing and waving smoothly with subtle air currents. 0–5s (The Turnaround): The model performs a slow, continuous 360-degree turnaround sequence on a fixed spot, displaying the front, side wrap silhouette, and low-cut back design of the dress seamlessly. 5–10s (Fabric Touch): Close-up macro cut as her hand gently runs down the side drape, highlighting the silk sheen. 10–15s (The Stride): She takes three fluid, natural walking strides directly toward the lens, the silk hem billowing elegantly around her legs.","videoId":null,"modelId":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","model":{"id":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","createdAt":"2026-04-10T13:00:31.405Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-23T14:55:48.019Z","key":"seedance-2-0","slug":"seedance-2-0","name":"Seedance 2.0","logo":"byteDance","type":"video","order":1,"toolId":"7yaoOMo1Aj","description":"Seedance 2.0 leading to the most comprehensive multimodal content reference and editing capabilities in the industry","freeGenerations":0,"maxPromptLength":5000,"pricePerUnit":2000,"minimumUnits":4,"unitLabelSingular":"video","unitLabelPlural":"videos","generationTime":300,"isActive":true,"isNew":null,"isPremium":true,"isFeatured":true,"hasGenerator":true,"totalItems":34,"provider":"fal","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-uwc70vdmqmiu-8dvxs8dvdzulrtqnlc04ee7e8374f9eae40adafba96b0199b3d05-Fm4tot","providerConfig":{"mappingExpression":"{\n    \"prompt\": prompt,\n    \"resolution\": config.resolution ?: \"480p\",\n    \"duration\": $string(config.duration) ?: \"4\",\n    \"aspect_ratio\": config.ratio ?: \"16:9\",\n    \"generate_audio\": config.generateAudio ?: false,\n    \"image_url\": config.promptImage,\n    \"end_image_url\": config.lastFrame\n}","requestEndpointSlug":"https://queue.fal.run/bytedance/seedance-2.0/requests/$REQUEST_ID","textToVideoEndpointSlug":"https://queue.fal.run/bytedance/seedance-2.0/text-to-video","imageToVideoEndpointSlug":"https://queue.fal.run/bytedance/seedance-2.0/image-to-video","videoToVideoEndpointSlug":null},"config":{"textTo