 online content"},{"label":"For commercial projects (online or TV ads.)","value":"For commercial projects (online or TV ads.)"},{"label":"For educational purposes","value":"For educational purposes"},{"label":"As a background video for my site","value":"As a background video for my site"},{"label":"Use it in my design as a placeholder","value":"Use it in my design as a placeholder"},{"label":"Education - I’m a teacher","value":"Education - I’m a teacher"},{"label":"Education - I’m a student","value":"Education - I’m a student"},{"label":"Zoom backgrounds","value":"Zoom backgrounds"},{"label":"Just for fun","value":"Just for fun"}],"smart_crop":{"info":"Smart crop explanation","title":"Choose Your Aspect Ratio","description":"Smart crop works best with custom ratios. Select anything other than ’Original’ or ’16:9’ to continue.’","explanation":"\u003Cb>Smart Crop:\u003C/b> Automatically optimize your video’s framing for any aspect ratio after selection. Ideal for videos with horizontal movement, this feature dynamically adjusts the crop to keep the main action in view, ensuring your subject remains the focal point across different formats. Please select your desired aspect ratio before activating Smart Crop for best results","toggle_explanation":"Select the aspect ratio and then our AI-powered smart crop feature will track objects in the video and automatically adjust the framing."},"validation":{"max_width":"Maximum width is {{ width }}","min_width":"Minimum width is {{ width }}","max_height":"Maximum height is {{ height }}","min_height":"Minimum height is {{ height }}","email_taken":"Email is already taken","max_size_mb":"Maximum size is {{ size }} MB","allowed_extensions":"Allowed extensions: {{ extensions }}","aspect_ratio_range":"Aspect ratio should be between {{ min }} and {{ max }}","failed_to_load_image":"Failed to load image","failed_to_load_video":"Failed to load video","image_size_too_large":"Image size is too large","invalid_aspect_ratio":"Invalid aspect r