xtensions":[]},"customOptions":null},"modes":[],"features":{"list":["edit-video"],"content":{"modelType":"In-context generative video editing and creation model","topUseCases":"Reframing and new camera angles for existing footage, Object insertion/removal and continuity fixes, Environment swaps and world-building, Style exploration and look development, Previz and concepting for ads, films, and social content","keyStrengths":"Cutting-edge realism, Precise scene-level control (angles/objects/environments), Versatile style application","primaryPurpose":"Edit and create videos by generating new camera angles, adding/removing objects, changing environments, and applying unique styles with high realism","bestFitScenarios":"Short-to-mid length shots with clear visual context, Rapid creative iteration on style and composition, Targeted edits to scenes (reframes, object edits, environment changes) where realism is paramount","knownLimitations":"May show temporal drift on long clips, Complex physics or fine text/graphics can be inconsistent, Identity or brand-perfect preservation may require manual supervision, Requires clear prompts and quality source context, Compute-intensive for high resolutions","poorFitScenarios":"Long-form sequences needing strict continuity across many minutes, Frame-perfect technical VFX (precise matchmoving/roto) or scientific accuracy, Scenes with heavy occlusion or chaotic motion, Tasks demanding guaranteed brand/logo or identity fidelity without manual QC"}},"featurePrices":null,"translations":{"de":{"description":"Runway Aleph ist ein AI-Video-Modell der nächsten Generation für die Kontext-Videobearbeitung und -Erstellung.Erzeugen Sie neue Kamerawinkel, fügen Sie Objekte hinzu oder entfernen Sie sie, ändern Sie Umgebungen und wenden Sie einzigartige Stile mit modernem Realismus an."},"es":{"description":"Runway Aleph es un modelo de vídeo de próxima generación de IA para la edición y creación de vídeo en contexto. genera nuevos ángulos de la cá