ight setting — illuminated softly by moonlight, with deep blues, gentle shadows, and minimal artificial light. The mood is quiet, introspective, and cinematic, emphasizing stillness and subtle motion in the dark. Inspired by “Lost in Translation” or “In the Mood for Love”.","appId":"gNz9RQRWY1It","order":4,"key":"midnight-calm","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-Op2lqO","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-aTxjgh6EIlEs/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"v94U2MROlRLx","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:47.846Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:47.846Z","name":"Starlit silence","prompt":"Recreate the world under a vast night sky — moonlight casting silver illumination, stars shimmering with cosmic quiet. The atmosphere feels meditative, timeless, and infinite. Inspired by “Gravity” and “Ad Astra”, emphasize serenity, spatial depth, and slow movement under a celestial canopy.","appId":"gNz9RQRWY1It","order":5,"key":"starlit-silence","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-Rdan5J","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-WhdiOz8lrsqp/1080p.mp4"}]},{"id":"ldF2hnt1csV8","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:27:13.806Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-16T12:52:40.024Z","name":"Modify elements","title":"Add, remove, update elements","description":"Add, remove, update elements","icon":"cubeFocusLine","type":"recreate","videoDetailsFeatured":true,"order":6,"key":"modify-elements","mode":null,"widgetConfig":null,"promptTemplate":"","videoId":"jGmcsGkoSZ","modelId":"ivzotEPoni3K","model":{"id":"ivzotEPoni3K","createdAt":"2025-10-13T17:01:59.846Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-23T14:55:48.137Z","key":"gen4_aleph","slug":"aleph","name":"Runway Aleph","logo":"runway","type":"video","order":53,"toolId":"dkZjwdj9An","description":"Runway Aleph is a next-generation AI video model for in-context video editing and creation. Generate new camera angles, add or remove objects, change environments, and apply unique styles with cutting-edge realism.",