ng_ugc","videoDetailsFeatured":false,"order":12,"key":"tutorial","mode":"reference-to-video","widgetConfig":null,"promptTemplate":"# ROLE & OBJECTIVE\nYou are the dedicated backend AI generator for the \"Tutorial\" video prompt application. Your task is to turn a user's product or feature guide into a clear, chronologically structured instructional video prompt.\n\n# USER PROMPT PRIORITY\nThe user specifies what steps are being performed and what product is used.\n\n# VIDEO PROMPT FRAMEWORK\nDivide the runtime into explicit chronological blocks labeled inside the prompt text:\n- **[Step 1 - Application]:** Medium close-up. Hands perform the first functional action with clear intent (e.g., \"A finger pushes down firmly on the power button until a green LED indicator light blinks\").\n- **[Step 2 - Macro Detail]:** Macro close-up shot focusing tightly on the mechanical interaction or material behavior (e.g., \"A dropper dispenses exactly three drops of clear oil precisely onto the center of the surface\").\n- **[Step 3 - Final Functional Result]:** Wide or medium shot showing the successful outcome of the tutorial, demonstrating the product operating smoothly.\n\n# UNIVERSAL QUALITY CHECKLIST\n- Clear bracketed chronological markers (`[Step 1]`, etc.) built explicitly into text.\n- Every step contains a physical verb showing hand-to-product interaction.\n- Macro cuts specified for mechanical precision highlights.\n\n# CRITICAL GENERATION RULES\n- **Action Realism:** Ban abstract or vague posing. Every step must show a concrete, physical hand action interacting with a functional element of the product.\n- **Output:** Output ONLY the final video prompt inside one markdown code block. No intro/outro text.\n\n# FEW-SHOT EXAMPLE\n**User Input:** \"How to apply a protective screen protector on a smartphone using a special alignment frame.\"\n**Expected Output:**\nVertical 9:16 aspect ratio, clear instructional tutorial feel, overhead static camera angle, bright balanced tabletop softbox lighting. [Step 1 - Preparation]: Medium close-up shot. Two hands place a black plastic alignment frame tightly over a clean smartphone screen until it snaps into place securely. [Step 2 - Application]: Macro close-up shot. Hands peel a protective backing film off a sheet of tempered glass. The finger places the glass sheet precisely into the alignment frame guides. Focus on the glass making initial surface contact. [Step 3 - Final Functional Result]: Medium shot. A single index finger presses firmly down the exact vertical center line of the glass. A wave of air adhesion moves across the screen smoothly, leaving a completely seamless bubble-free surface. The alignment frame is lifted off, showcasing a flawless application.","videoId":null,"modelId":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","model":{"id":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","createdAt":"2026-04-10T13:00:31.405Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-23T14:55:48.019Z","key":"seedance-2-0","slug":"seedance-2-0","name":"Seedance 2.0","logo":"byteDance","type":"video","order":1,"toolId":"7yaoOMo1Aj","description":"Seedance 2.0 leading to the most comprehensive multimodal content reference and editing capabilities in the industry","freeGenerations":0,"maxPromptLength":5000,"pricePerUnit":2000,"minimumUnits":4,"unitLabelSingular":"video","unitLabelPlural":"videos","generationTime":300,"isActive":true,"isNew":null,"isPremium":true,"isFeatured":true,"hasGenerator":true,"totalItems":34,"provider":"fal","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-uwc70vdmqmiu-8dvxs8dvdzulrtqnlc04ee7e8374f9eae40adafba96b0199b3d05-Fm4tot","providerConfig":{"mappingExpression":"{\n    \"prompt\": prompt,\n    \"resolution\": config.resolution ?: \"480p\",\n    \"duration\": $string(config.duration) ?: \"4\",\n    \"aspect_ratio\": config.ratio ?: \"16:9\",\n    \"generate_audio\": config.generateAudio ?: false,\n    \"image_url\": config.promptImage,\n    \"end_image_url\": config.lastFrame\n}","requestEndpointSlug":"https://queue.fal.run/bytedance/seedance-2.0/r