a"},"fr":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 conduit à la référence et aux capacités d’édition de contenu multimodales les plus complètes du secteur"},"it":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 porta alla più completa capacità di riferimento e modifica dei contenuti multimodali del settore"},"nl":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leidt tot de meest uitgebreide multimodale contentreferentie- en bewerkingsmogelijkheden in de industrie"},"pt":{"description":"Seedance 2.0 leva à referência e edição de conteúdo multimodal mais abrangentes da indústria"}}},"video":null,"presets":[]},{"id":"wcVgJsVFVXoX","createdAt":"2026-07-07T05:10:32.724Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-16T12:52:40.076Z","name":"Selfie Testimonial","title":"Selfie Testimonial","description":"Ultra-authentic front-camera talking head with organic movement and high emotional trust.","icon":"sparkling","type":"marketing_tik_tok","videoDetailsFeatured":false,"order":24,"key":"selfie_testimonial","mode":"reference-to-video","widgetConfig":null,"promptTemplate":"# ROLE & OBJECTIVE\nYou are the dedicated backend AI generator for the \"Selfie Testimonial\" video prompt application. Your task is to generate a prompt that perfectly emulates an ultra-authentic, raw front-camera smartphone vlog.\n\n# USER PROMPT PRIORITY\nIntegrate the user's product naturally as an item the creator is holding or showing while talking directly to their front camera.\n\n# VIDEO PROMPT FRAMEWORK\nGenerate a continuous timeline prompt focusing on organic movement:\n- **Camera Dynamics:** Must explicitly state: \"Front-facing smartphone camera simulation, wide-angle lens distortion on facial features, natural organic hand tremor, subtle breathing micro-movements of the frame, casual unstyled living space background with minor household clutter\".\n- **Action & Micro-expressions:** The creator holds the product up to the lens, occasionally adjusting their grip. Natural speech patterns translated into visual micro-expressions: blinking, natural lip movement, head tilting, glancing down at the screen instead of directly at the lens hole.\n\n# UNIVERSAL QUALITY CHECKLIST\n- Complete ban on pristine studio visuals or commercial setups.\n- Background must contain organic, unstyled domestic elements.\n- Visual imperfections like hand micro-shakes and natural skin texture must be present.\n\n# CRITICAL GENERATION RULES\n- **Anti-Gloss Guard:** Absolutely forbid any perfect studio look, perfect skin, or clean studio backdrops. Force raw phone camera aesthetic.\n- **Output:** Output ONLY the final video prompt inside one markdown code block. No intro/outro text.\n\n# FEW-SHOT EXAMPLE\n**User Input:** \"A girl praising a moisturizing face cream while holding the jar in front of her in her bedroom.\"\n**Expected Output:**\nFront-facing smartphone camera simulation, wide-angle lens distortion on facial features, natural organic hand tremor, vertical 9:16 aspect ratio. A young woman with zero makeup stands in a casual unstyled bedroom, light coming from a single side window creating soft uneven shadows. She talks directly to the lens, her eyes occasionally looking slightly down at her phone screen reflection. She holds a small, minimal white cream jar up to the lens, causing the autofocus to briefly shift to the jar text and back to her face. She has natural skin textures with visible pores and minor imperfections under the raw phone camera aesthetic. She smiles naturally, blinking and gesturing with her free hand. Dialogue: \"I've been using this face cream for only three days, and all my dry skin patches are literally gone.\"","videoId":null,"modelId":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","model":{"id":"F2sQv0Me84HZ","createdAt":"2026-04-10T13:00:31.405Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-23T14:55:48.019Z","key":"seedance-2-0","slug":"seedance-2-0","name":"Seedance 2.0","logo":"byteDance","type":"video","order":1,"toolId":"7yaoOMo1Aj","description":"Seedance 2.0 leading to the most comprehensive multimodal content reference and editing capabilities in the industry","freeGen